# testing
coverage
# A location's Coverage tab and the Coverage screen across locations are
# routes, not test output. The brackets are escaped: unescaped, [slug] would
# match one letter.
!apps/admin/app/(console)/locations/\[slug\]/coverage/
!apps/admin/app/(console)/coverage/

